INV-kazij's axis is the install set (and the mechanism hunt narrows to
what a meta distribution's presence changes — analyzer_identity walks
importlib.metadata.distributions()); if it stays red, the axis is the
container/interpreter interaction and INV-libib's per-leg log fix
becomes the prerequisite. Either way the two whole-suite pipelines stop
differing silently in what they install — that drift is worth removing
on its own.

